clear at -3.96 46.72 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -33.57 46.76 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -37.04 6.51 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -39.55 -1.47 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -40.32 39.01 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -44.67 43.51 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -46.39 39.40 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -9.83 41.36 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at 4.20 -47.26 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at 7.73 -44.01 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2

save Tangaroa Remade
